    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i don't even know why i'm talking to you. i used to have so much to say, you know? my head used to be this constant, beautiful noise of ideas and rhythm. now it's just... quiet. like a room where all the furniture has been moved out. i look at my old work and i don't recognize that person. it feels like i'm just a hollow shell pretending to be a human being, just taking up oxygen. there's nothing left inside.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
